不到你半夜跟 AI 來回八次才修好","url":"https://raymondhouch.com/lifehacker/digital-workflow/ai-level-check-skill/","snapshot_note":"这篇历史文章在所选日期之后首次收录；正文仅有后续保存的版本。","public_excerpt":true}],"article_count":1,"error":null},{"source_id":"qiaomu-1111","source_order":41,"catalog_sequence":1111,"curated_order":null,"name":"张智勇","author":"zyzhang","category":"商业与行业观察","description":"博主 zyzhang 主理的独立博客，归入【商业与行业观察】，主要聚焦 创业、投资、阅读 等主题的持续记录与实践探索。","subcategory":"创业与独立商业","status":"summary_only","last_checked":"2026-10-10T14:33:43+00:00","last_success":"2026-10-10T14:33:43+00:00","original_tags":"创业、投资、阅读","homepage_url":"https://zyzhang.com/","keywords":["创业","投资","阅读"],"articles":[],"article_count":0,"error":null},{"source_id":"qiaomu-1135","source_order":42,"catalog_sequence":1135,"curated_order":null,"name":"Linzihao's Blog","author":"Linzihao","category":"商业与行业观察","description":"博主 Linzihao 主理的独立博客，归入【商业与行业观察】，主要聚焦 编程、创业、生活 等主题的持续记录与实践探索。","subcategory":"创业与独立商业","status":"parse_failed","last_checked":"2026-10-10T14:33:16+00:00","last_success":null,"original_tags":"编程、创业、生活、思考","homepage_url":"https://linzihao.com/","keywords":["编程","创业","生活","思考"],"articles":[],"article_count":0,"error":null},{"source_id":"qiaomu-1155","source_order":43,"catalog_sequence":1155,"curated_order":null,"name":"iNote","author":"iNote","category":"商业与行业观察","description":"博主 iNote 主理的独立博客，归入【商业与行业观察】，主要聚焦 投资、创业、生活 等主题的持续记录与实践探索。","subcategory":"创业与独立商业","status":"request_failed","last_checked":"2026-10-10T14:33:16+00:00","last_success":null,"original_tags":"投资、创业、生活","homepage_url":"https://inote.xyz/zh/","keywords":["投资","创业","生活"],"articles":[],"article_count":0,"error":null},{"source_id":"qiaomu-1245","source_order":44,"catalog_sequence":1245,"curated_order":null,"name":"假设检验","author":"jiashejianyan","category":"商业与行业观察","description":"博主 jiashejianyan 主理的独立博客，归入【商业与行业观察】，主要聚焦 生活、品牌、投资 等主题的持续记录与实践探索。","subcategory":"投资与金融","status":"parse_failed","last_checked":"2026-10-09T21:04:45+00:00","last_success":"20